<title>USA: Ethan Allen sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Ethan Allen sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>DANBURY, Conn. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ethan Allen Interiors Inc said Wednesday it has set a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The company currently has about 14.7 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The additional shares from the split are to be distributed on September 2 to shareholders of record as of August 18.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
